<title>USA: PIMCO in talks to buy Oppenheimer stake - WSJ.</title>
<headline>PIMCO in talks to buy Oppenheimer stake - WSJ.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>PIMCO Advisors LP is in talks to buy a one-third interest in Oppenheimer Capital LP from Oppenheimer Group Inc for about $275 million, the Wall Street Journal said Tuesday.</p>
<p>Quoting people familiar with the matter, the paper said discussions over the sale of the institutional money-management company could fall apart still.</p>
<p>Negotiations in such a deal last year broke off over price but have renewed recently, the report said.</p>
<p>-- New York newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
</text>
